.TH TWEEN_UPDATE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
tween_update \- Advance a tween by dt, writing the new value through its target pointer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "void tween_update(Tween *tw, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance a tween by dt, writing the new value through its target pointer. Call from update, once per tick, for every tween you own; an inactive tween costs nothing. On the tick it finishes the target is set exactly to `to`.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tween_start (3),
.BR tween_done (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
